```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "list the pet names a named sensorium holds"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///sense.petname.lists", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/sense.petname.lists"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/sense.petname.lists"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! sense.petname.lists ~ the pet names one sensorium holds

`lares sensorium names <sensorium>` lists the attached and proposed pet names of a named sensorium.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ names

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`names` params=`sensorium/memory ~ list the pet names`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ sensorium

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`sensorium` params=`takes/name needs/required seat/1 as/<sensorium> ~ a named sensorium standing on this house`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ works this host's scratch sensoria under the cache; this handler checks no ocap`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[sense.petname.lists sensorium/memory]] ~ name a standing sensorium`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ listed

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`listed` params=`exit/0 ~ the pet name entries`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares sensorium names

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host door/part spells/[[lares sensorium names]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~/ahu>>

